{
  "_": [
    "star_wars_pro on Llyrric's 'star wars stern layout' (13 Jul 25; TableInfo 'Star Wars Pro 2017',",
    "'Original based on Stern Layout'), a scripted original with no ROM (LoadEM; controller.vbs",
    "embedded only for B2S/DOF). Its playfield IS the Pro's: every target, lane and insert lands on",
    "the Pro's switch_xy/led_io positions under one affine fit, and it has no fork ramp or",
    "accelerator (the LE's extra switches), so this is a Pro map.",
    "Three things differ from the Rush/Foo Fighters maps, all in extra_vbs:",
    "1. The table object is SW2017, not Table1: the bridge's Table1_* subs never fire as events, so",
    "   SW2017_Init/KeyDown/KeyUp/Exit are quieted (renamed _orig) and extra_vbs redefines them to",
    "   call the bridge and then the originals (VBScript keeps the last definition of a Sub).",
    "2. PHYSICAL trough (six balls created in kicker1 + swTrough2..6, gBOT used for roll sounds and",
    "   shadows): kept. Each trough kicker is a hold switch (Trough 1..6), extra_vbs's Drain_Hit",
    "   kicks into the trough as the table did, the TROUGH coil kicks kicker1. bsTrough is inert.",
    "3. PinUP: the script creates PuPlayer twice, once outside any Sub at load; pup_stub wraps only",
    "   the first (in PuPInit), so LoadCoreFiles (called at line 143, before the load-time block) is",
    "   redefined to set PuPlayer = New PadNoPuP first.",
    "Unmapped: flipper EOS (46, 61), trough jam (68), 10 PT (85, no object), R2-D2 head optos",
    "(95-97, no mech). Coils with no table mech: L/R control gates, up post-loop, double post."
  ],
