  "extra_vbs": "'---- PAD: this table's object is SW2017, not Table1, so VPX never fires the\n'     bridge's Table1_* events; the table's own SW2017_* subs are renamed _orig\n'     (quiet_subs) and these stand in for the empty stubs (VBScript keeps the\n'     LAST definition of a Sub, and these come last).\nSub SW2017_Init()\n\tSW2017_Init_orig\n\tTable1_Init\n\tB2SOn = False\n\tB2SOnALT = False\n\tPadTroughSync\nEnd Sub\nSub SW2017_Exit()\n\tTable1_Exit\n\tSW2017_Exit_orig\nEnd Sub\nSub SW2017_Paused()\n\tTable1_Paused\nEnd Sub\nSub SW2017_UnPaused()\n\tTable1_UnPaused\nEnd Sub\nFunction PadMachineKey(k)\n\tSelect Case k\n\t\tCase StartGameKey, AddCreditKey, AddCreditKey2, LockBarKey, LeftFlipperKey, RightFlipperKey\n\t\t\tPadMachineKey = True\n\t\tCase Else\n\t\t\tPadMachineKey = False\n\tEnd Select\nEnd Function\nSub SW2017_KeyDown(ByVal keycode)\n\tTable1_KeyDown keycode\n\tIf Not PadMachineKey(keycode) Then\n\t\tSW2017_KeyDown_orig keycode\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub SW2017_KeyUp(ByVal keycode)\n\tTable1_KeyUp keycode\n\tIf Not PadMachineKey(keycode) Then\n\t\tSW2017_KeyUp_orig keycode\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\n\n'---- PAD: PinUP Player made optional BEFORE the table's own load-time\n'     CreateObject (outside any Sub, under On Error Resume Next): without PuP\n'     it leaves PuPlayer as it was, so it must already be the stand-in, or the\n'     table's \"HasPuP = False\" (a Const) dies of Illegal assignment\nSub LoadCoreFiles\n\tLoadCoreFiles_orig\n\tSet PuPlayer = New PadNoPuP\nEnd Sub\n\n'---- PAD: the table's PHYSICAL trough stays (its six balls live in kicker1 and\n'     swTrough2..6, which roll them on by UpdateTrough); each kicker is its\n'     Trough switch, the drain kicks into the trough as the table always did,\n'     and the TROUGH coil kicks kicker1 into the shooter lane. bsTrough is\n'     inert (0 balls, nothing calls it).\nSub Drain_Hit\n\tvpmTimer.AddTimer 500, \"Drain.kick 57, 20'\"\n\tRandomSoundDrain Drain\nEnd Sub\nSub PadTroughSync\n\tController.Switch(1067) = (kicker1.BallCntOver > 0)\n\tController.Switch(1066) = (swTrough2.BallCntOver > 0)\n\tController.Switch(1065) = (swTrough3.BallCntOver > 0)\n\tController.Switch(1064) = (swTrough4.BallCntOver > 0)\n\tController.Switch(1063) = (swTrough5.BallCntOver > 0)\n\tController.Switch(1062) = (swTrough6.BallCntOver > 0)\nEnd Sub\nSub PadTroughOut(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tIf kicker1.BallCntOver > 0 Then\n\t\t\tkicker1.Kick 90, 10\n\t\t\tRandomSoundBallRelease kicker1\n\t\tEnd If\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadAutoPlunge(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tAutoPlungeBall\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadResetDrops(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tDT1.IsDropped = 0\n\t\tDT2.IsDropped = 0\n\t\tDT3.IsDropped = 0\n\t\tDT4.IsDropped = 0\n\t\tDT5.IsDropped = 0\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadLockPost(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tleftrampmagnet.Enabled = True\n\tElse\n\t\tleftrampmagnet.Kick 180, 2\n\t\tleftrampmagnet.Enabled = False\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadTieShake(e)\n\tbTieFighterShakeOngoing = e\nEnd Sub\n",
